// captures (which the demo has none of): three phone screens of one flow at
// 375×760, one wide analysis screen at 1200×760, and one interface drawn four
// times (the original plus the three colour-vision simulations) at 640×400.
// The sizes differ on purpose, so the demo proves the strip lines up screens of
// different ratios and the grid gives each comparison view half the column.
//
//   node tools/gen-assets.mjs [outDir]      (default: ./assets)
